id=qp_refresh165
name=Quest Pro Display Overclock 165
version=v3.2
versionCode=9
author=CreoleVR
description=unlocks 100/110/120/144/165 hz on the meta quest pro (seacliff). live-patches the dsi refresh-rate table and re-inits the display composers so the rates appear; head tracking and passthrough are preserved. switches meta's compositor to direct mode so 144/165 hz show every frame, and delays each slice per refresh rate (meta's debug.oculus.sliceDelay) so direct mode doesn't tear; falls back to writeback if a boot doesn't finish. applied in memory at boot - no system partition touched - so disabling reverts the headset. replaces qp_refresh120.
